sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant CO as Coordinator
    participant P as Primary (down)
    participant N1 as Next Replica
    participant H as Hint Store on N1

    CO->>P: write key K
    P--xCO: timeout
    CO->>N1: write K + hint(for=P)
    N1->>H: store data + hint
    Note over H: When P recovers, N1 hands off K
    N1-->>CO: ack
